OL,3,GNEWSADriver who caused death of
OL,4,AOlympian sentenced
OL,5,
OL,6,FWilliam Langley, 38, of Pateley Bridge,
OL,7,Fadmitted causing death by careless
OL,8,Fdriving and was sentenced to a 26-week
OL,9,Fjail sentence suspended for 12 months.
